<BaseLayout
  title="How to Move Into Older Historic Homes in Denver With Narrow Hallways and Staircases | Legacy Moving Denver"
  description="Moving into a historic Denver home in Capitol Hill, Potter-Highlands, or the Platt Park area? Narrow halls, steep stairs, and tight doorways require a different approach. Here's what to know."
